    "Administrator's Guide": "도메인 관리자의 가이드",
    "Defining Storage Policies": "보관ПолICY를 정의하는",
    "Defining your Storage Policies is very easy to do with Swift.  It is important that the administrator understand the concepts behind Storage Policies before actually creating and using them in order to get the most benefit out of the feature and, more importantly, to avoid having to make unnecessary changes once a set of policies have been deployed to a cluster.": "Swift을 사용하여 보관 ПолICY를 정의는 매우 쉽습니다.  管理자는 보관 폴리시의Concepts를 이해해야 실제로 생성하고 사용할 수 있습니다. thereby最大限度の利点을 얻을 수 있으며, 가장 importantly는 비용이ไม 필요한 수정을 피할 수 있습니다. 보관 폴리시가 배포되는クラ스터에 Deployed했다면",
    "It is highly recommended that the reader fully read and comprehend :doc:`overview_policies` before proceeding with administration of policies.  Plan carefully and it is suggested that experimentation be done first on a non-production cluster to be certain that the desired configuration meets the needs of the users.  See :ref:`upgrade-policy` before planning the upgrade of your existing deployment.": "이서 :doc:`overview_policies`를 fully読고 이해한다면정책 administeringproceeding을할 수 있습니다. carefully plan을하고 experimentation을first한 non-production cluster에서Experiment first을suggest합니다. thereby desired configuration이user의 needs와一致하도록합니다. See:ref:`upgrade-policy`beforeplanning your existing deploymentupgrade.",
    "Following is a high level view of the very few steps it takes to configure policies once you have decided what you want to do:": "다음은policy를정의하는very fewsteps의 high-levelview입니다.",
    "Define your policies in ``/etc/swift/swift.conf``": "정책을 /etc/swift/swift.conf 에서 정의하세요.",
    "Create the corresponding object rings": "corresponding object rings를 생성하세요.",
    "Communicate the names of the Storage Policies to cluster users": "Storage Policy 이름을 클러스터 사용자에게 communicates합니다.",
    "For a specific example that takes you through these steps, please see :doc:`policies_saio`": "specific example에 대한 step-by-step instructions는 :doc:`policies_saio`에서 볼 수 있습니다.",
    "Managing the Rings": "Rings를 관리합니다.",
    "You may build the storage rings on any server with the appropriate version of Swift installed.  Once built or changed (rebalanced), you must distribute the rings to all the servers in the cluster.  Storage rings contain information about all the Swift storage partitions and how they are distributed between the different nodes and disks.": "스튜어트에 적합한 버전을 설치한 서버上 любую.storage-ring를 구축할 수 있습니다. 構築 또는 재조정 (리abalенс) 후, storage-ring에는.cluster 모든 servers에게 distribution되어 있습니다.  Storage-ring는 스티븐storage-partitions 및它们가 different node와 disk 사이에 how phân포하는 information을 contains합니다.",
    "Swift 1.6.0 is the last version to use a Python pickle format. Subsequent versions use a different serialization format.  **Rings generated by Swift versions 1.6.0 and earlier may be read by any version, but rings generated after 1.6.0 may only be read by Swift versions greater than 1.6.0.**  So when upgrading from version 1.6.0 or earlier to a version greater than 1.6.0, either upgrade Swift on your ring building server **last** after all Swift nodes have been successfully upgraded, or refrain from generating rings until all Swift nodes have been successfully upgraded.": "스튜어트 1.6.0 버전은 Python pickle 형식 사용 but earlier versions use different serialization format.  **1.6.0 later ring 생성은 only read be 수 Swift version greater than 1.6.0** . upgrade from 1.6.0 or earlier version to greater 1.6.0.version에서, either ring-building server upgrading **last** after all Swift nodes have successfully upgraded, or refrain generating ring until all Swift nodes have successfully upgraded.",
    "If you need to downgrade from a version of Swift greater than 1.6.0 to a version less than or equal to 1.6.0, first downgrade your ring-building server, generate new rings, push them out, then continue with the rest of the downgrade.": "Downgrade from Swift greater than 1.6.0 versions less than or equal to 1.6.0 first downgrading server, new ring generate, push out then continue downgrade.",
    "For more information see :doc:`overview_ring`.": "더 많은 정보는 :doc:`overview_ring`.",
